>>
Rule 2 (tensor shapes are positive)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) > 0 ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_2) - 1] : shape(v_2, i) > 0
>>
Rule 4 (tensor a and b have the same number of dimensions)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) = ndim(v_2)
