Rule 5 (tensor a and b have the same shape)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) = shape(v_2, i)
>>
Rule 7 (check if the number of dimensions of v_1 and v_2 is equal to 4)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) = 4 ∧ ndim(v_2) = 4
